<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Calpine rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Calpine rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it had started coverage of Calpine Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Calpine, a power generating company, opened up 1/8 to 16-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
